          "inserted": "\n-- Both delta controls close before the seal.\n\nsection\nvariable {k : \u2115} {\u0393 S : Type} {x : List \u0393} (M : Turing.MultiTapeTM k \u0393 S)\n  (F : Set (Option S)) (P : (Fin k \u2192 \u2124) \u2192 Prop) (a b : Turing.Cfg k \u0393 S x) (t : \u2115)\nexample : Turing.Segment M F P a b t \u2194\n    M.runFrom a t = b \u2227 (\u2200 u < t, (M.runFrom a u).state \u2209 F) \u2227\n      \u2200 u \u2264 t, P (M.runFrom a u).workTapePos := by\n  rfl\nexample : Turing.Segment M F P a b t =\n    (M.runFrom a t = b \u2227 (\u2200 u < t, (M.runFrom a u).state \u2209 F) \u2227\n      \u2200 u \u2264 t, P (M.runFrom a u).workTapePos) := by\n  rfl\nend\n\nattribute [local irreducible] Turing.Segment\n-- The identical rfl attempts fail after the seal; the public equation closes them.\n\nsection\nvariable {k : \u2115} {\u0393 S : Type} {x : List \u0393} (M : Turing.MultiTapeTM k \u0393 S)\n  (F : Set (Option S)) (P : (Fin k \u2192 \u2124) \u2192 Prop) (a b : Turing.Cfg k \u0393 S x) (t : \u2115)\nexample : Turing.Segment M F P a b t \u2194\n    M.runFrom a t = b \u2227 (\u2200 u < t, (M.runFrom a u).state \u2209 F) \u2227\n      \u2200 u \u2264 t, P (M.runFrom a u).workTapePos := by\n  fail_if_success rfl\n  exact Turing.segment_iff M F P a b t\nexample : Turing.Segment M F P a b t =\n    (M.runFrom a t = b \u2227 (\u2200 u < t, (M.runFrom a u).state \u2209 F) \u2227\n      \u2200 u \u2264 t, P (M.runFrom a u).workTapePos) := by\n  fail_if_success rfl\n  exact propext (Turing.segment_iff M F P a b t)\nend\n"
